# Decision

This source documents "Decision" as a universal mental model for navigating complex situations through pattern and relationship recognition. It is referenced in 58 sources including Richard Thaler's Misbehaving, Donella Meadows' Limits to Growth, Timothy Ferriss' The 4-Hour Body, Nassim Taleb's Antifragile, and Daniel Kahneman's Noise. The page serves as a hub linking to existing decision-making concepts in the wiki such as decision-making-frameworks, decision-quality-vs-outcome-quality, and decision-making-under-uncertainty.
